        </mxCell>
        <object id="access-rule" label="Use only platforms the company is allowed to access. Knowing the supplier’s provider name is not enough." link="../../specs/invoice-receiving/SPEC-SEI-026-invoice-retrieval-logical-feature-specification.md#34-process-review-proposal">
